      "video_id": "cTloVlnYuvV",
      "video_ratio": null,
      "description_html": "<p>Dreaming of travelling solo in Asia after 50, but unsure where to begin?</p><p>Join Angela Jane, founder of Travels of the World, for a five-step confidence plan drawn from her own experiences in Japan, Nepal, India and Bali.</p><p>Discover how to choose a trip with purpose, find your balance of independence and support, travel at your own pace and feel more prepared for arrival. You’ll leave with five questions to shape your first trip and one manageable action to take this week.</p>",
