      "description_html": "<p>Here’s the new description, about 90 words:</p><p>Travel Southeast Asia with confidence! Tina, a nurse who slow travels through the region, shares what really goes wrong for travelers and how to keep it from happening to you.</p><p>You’ll learn how to:</p><ul><li>Pack medications legally</li><li>Enjoy street food without getting sick</li><li>Handle the heat and spot heat stroke</li><li>Prevent dengue, rabies and scooter injuries</li><li>Find good care and make sure your insurance covers you</li></ul><p>Plus, download our free “Stay Healthy in SE Asia” toolkit. It lists the apps we use for air quality, doctor visits, rides, phone data and money, and it includes money-saving discount codes.</p>",
